DESCRIPTION:🌙 Closure in the late evening or overnight only\n\nHackney 
 Downs to Chingford after 22:45\nDates as listed by TfL: Monday 21 December
  to Tuesday 22 December 2026\n\nTfL live status (Part Closure\, checked 27
  November 2026): WEAVER LINE: Monday 21 and Tuesday 22 December\, after 22
 45 each evening\, no service between Hackney Downs and Chingford. Last thr
 ough trains operate at 2231 from Liverpool Street and at 2253 from Chingfo
 rd. Replacement bus service L3 operates between Hackney Downs and Chingfor
 d via Clapton\, St James Street\, Walthamstow Central\, Wood Street and Hi
 ghams Park. The last three northbound buses operate from Liverpool Street 
 at 0014 0044 and 0114 and also call at Bethnal Green\, Cambridge Heath and
  London Fields (Mare Street)\n\nSource: TfL planned track closures\, corre
 ct at Monday 16 November 2026. https://tfl.gov.uk/api/document/plannedtrac
 kclosures.pdf?id=accc98cf-e761-47b3-a43b-3de08a097b8f&type=document\nPlans
